 the Priestess of Fire, Shayla."},{"title":"A Golden Opportunity","synopsis":"While others are seeking a way home, Nanami is working."},{"title":"Reunion","synopsis":"Miz Mistal wishes for Mr. Fujisawa's love at a legendary fountain; when it malfunctions, she fears a catastrophe has occurred."},{"title":"House of Thieves","synopsis":"Nanami decides to open her own restaurant; when the kingdom's vegetables suddenly go missing, Makoto attempts to solve the mystery."},{"title":"The Jungle Beast","synopsis":"A village is being threatened by a monster who's is attacking its crops and livestock; seeking adventure, Mr. Fujisawa volunteers to go on a monster hunt."},{"title":"A Child`s Heart","synopsis":"Makoto and Mr. Fujisawa decide to help Rune Venus take care of some orphaned children."},{"title":"Tomb of the Demon God","synopsis":"An oppressive heat wave covers the land."},{"title":"Pure Evil Genius","synopsis":"The ultimate weapon has awoken, and she's under the control of Jinnai."},{"title":"The Legendary Snowfield","synopsis":"One of the seven wonders of El-Hazard, the Legendary Snow falls only once every 100 years."},{"title":"Tale of the Priestesses","synopsis":"A flashback to Shayla's encounter with an apprentice priestess that changed her destiny."},{"title":"Whirlwind","synopsis":"A gigantic whirlwind appears in the deserts of Roshtaria."},{"title":"The Eye of God","synopsis":"Rune Venus dreams of a golden room from her childhood, and wonders if it's the Chamber of Promises; Makoto goes with her to investigate."},{"title":"Operation: Abduction!","synopsis":"Jinnai attempts to reverse his fortunes with a daring plan."},{"title":"Hive of Darkness","synopsis":"Makoto and Mr. Fujisawa are in hot pursuit of Jinnai in an attempt to rescue Rune Venus."},{"title":"Jinnai: Sister vs. Brother","synopsis":"Jinnai's decision to kidnap Nanami along with Rune Venus backfires when she discovers she can speak to the Bugrom."},{"title":"A Love in Peril","synopsis":"The Great Saint River is a dangerous, forbidden sanctuary."},{"title":"A Death-Defying Rescue","synopsis":"Makoto will have to face the Bugrom, Ifurita, and Jinnai's greatest trump card: Rune Venus."},{"title":"Escape","synopsis":"While Afura Mann and the Bugrom are searching for the Princess, Nanami has already found her."},{"title":"Destiny","synopsis":"Cataclysms rock the world and the Bugrom launch an all-out invasion; worst of all, the Eye of God is falling out of its orbit."},{"title":"The End of the World","synopsis":"Jinnai's dreams of conquest are about to come to fruition, but when Ifurita's personality abruptly changes, he looses control of her."},{"title":"The Eternal Dream","synopsis":"Makoto releases the reactor energy from the Eye of God."}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
